# Postmortem Professor: Bot2's Bolt kills it, so the only instant in a graveyard is Bot2's. The ability exiles an instant or sorcery card from *your*
# graveyard (Bot1's holds just the Professor), so Bot1 cannot activate it even with the mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Postmortem Professor
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Postmortem Professor.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Postmortem Professor)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Graveyard.Postmortem Professor.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Postmortem Professor
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl
